    "statement": "Constraint predicates unwrap typed SQLite result codes rather than inspect message text. UNIQUE alone differs from row-identity conflicts, which also include PRIMARYKEY; FOREIGNKEY and CHECK classify separately, and the constraint family includes NOTNULL. Nil and non-driver errors do not classify. Production SQLite result constants stay in sqlitedb. Classifiers neither replace errors nor choose store failure kinds, retry or recovery policy."
